{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1671","id":4110646846,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p871A34-","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1671","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1671.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1671.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1671","number":1671,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[9709] Full-corpus structural production batch 005","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1670.\n\nParent program: #1649. Inventory/schema authority: #1650 / PR #1652. Predecessor: #1665 / PR #1668.\n\n## What changed\n\nThis PR delivers governed structural production Batch005 for the frozen 27-paper, 227-question membership. It binds the run to exact main `c886c49ccf5daa953a00ad60708ed2d00c0c2750`, the frozen plan SHA-256 `ece7616851799cb2984d21535b0ca6f3b3cb2555327ed2bbba350834afa3cbdd`, and the reviewed Batch004 v4 artifact and reconstruction hashes.\n\nThe local AI2-PC maker ran serially at concurrency 1 with write-once checkpoints. It produced 224 maker-complete rows and three explicit fail-closed safe rejections from terminal normalization/provider failures. The run made 454 bounded pass calls, recorded zero retries, and repeated no terminal call.\n\nCandidate-blind AO verification covers 227/227 primary reads and 227/227 independent second reads, including the frozen 179-row high-risk denominator. Deterministic comparison produced 93 verified agreements, 131 resolver-required disagreements, and three safe rejections. Independent source-only AO resolvers adjudicated all 131 disagreements across disjoint complete-paper ownership shards with zero provider calls, false accepts, or false overrides.\n\nA bounded additive v2 queue receipt corrects the initial zero-conflict-shard ownership projection. It preserves v1 bytes and proves all 27 frozen papers are assigned exactly once across three nine-paper resolver shards; it does not introduce a repair framework or any paper/question special case.\n\nFinal artifact-only conservation is:\n\n`227 = 131 resolver_verified + 93 verified_agreement + 3 safe_rejection + 0 conflict + 0 unresolved`\n\nThe verified staging artifact contains 224 topology-valid rows. No semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, downstream, paid, or external-VLM writes were made, and no Batch001-Batch004 artifact was rewritten.\n\n## Final evidence\n\n- Active artifact manifest v2 SHA-256: `639f06f603a753a1dc0f99e2d25b1403ce40ce69c6b02c76d6591f899879bfde`\n- Active deterministic reconstruction v2 SHA-256: `7a3c2c8147b7c64af623cc19e667d40200de458429959d5aad6d654ffb2e9f2f`\n- Active dependency freeze v3 SHA-256: `84255c455f06186f6cf064f7b1d86f977026ffe33f530f78340483366a3b292a`\n- Immutable artifact manifest v1 SHA-256: `25774316ed8116d60477033bec47ba63f0b3056b9926e7ca8d16fcdcf19c6eab`\n- Immutable deterministic reconstruction v1 SHA-256: `0e59093577a1aaa84fbc991785772333baf734bbdadb5788b3b4a3fa19eb5832`\n- Maker checkpoint SHA-256: `277955f50ec4aa84836aaf84810907952411770a76fda62701880bcb965ae3fc`\n- Verification ledger SHA-256: `4170f59abb2ab4131ab735b6ee57fc2307d378c12960492f6693b5c411a1152e`\n- Verified staging SHA-256: `01d12dc7aa74e1d81d2ff47845103ac5a0ecd4c62a6140963ca7b9b2c4be0189`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `uv run --with pymupdf --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1670_structural_batch_005.py validate-packets-v5`\n- `uv run --with pymupdf --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1670_structural_batch_005.test.py` (5/5)\n- `uv run --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1670_resolution.test.py` (5/5)\n- `uv run --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1670_reconcile.py import-checkers`\n- `uv run --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1670_reconcile.py correct-resolver-ownership`\n- `uv run --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1670_reconcile.py publish-review-corrections`\n- `uv run --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1670_finalize_resolution.py finalize-resolution`\n- `uv run --with jsonschema env PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1670_finalize_resolution.py publish-final-evidence`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (healthy branch/artifact guards; expected warning only while final files were pending commit)\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T18:17:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T18:37:37Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T18:37:36Z","merged_at":"2026-07-22T18:37:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"74616ba0aabd0c50a8998bec6ef33848f07354c3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1671/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1671/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pul